QUERY PLAN
SeqScan (e) [id, v]
  (cost=1.00 rows=0)
=== SHAPE B — top-level (no parens) form: grammar asymmetry, strict whitelist ===
=== Shape B1: top-level GENERIC_PLAN — 1064 at SELECT (Column 30) ===
EXPLAIN ANALYZE GENERIC_PLAN SELECT * FROM e;
ERROR 1064: SQL parse error: sql parser error: Expected: end of statement, found: SELECT at Line: 1, Column: 30
=== Shape B2: top-level comma — 1064 at comma (Column 16) ===
EXPLAIN ANALYZE, BUFFERS SELECT * FROM e;
ERROR 1064: SQL parse error: sql parser error: Expected: identifier, found: , at Line: 1, Column: 16
=== SHAPE C — SUPPORT: bare EXPLAIN baseline (re-pin from explain_basic_extra) ===
EXPLAIN SELECT * FROM e;
QUERY PLAN
SeqScan (e) [id, v]
  (cost=1.00 rows=0)
=== Cleanup ===
DROP TABLE e;
